Keep a shared source as empty text.
Keep a shared possible as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared fresh as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared limit as 0.
Place "(*))" into source.
For every slot from 0 to 102.
Place 0 into possible.
Place 0 into fresh.

Set limit to the last position of source.
Set item 0 of possible to 1.

To wipe from marker (a whole number).
For every balance from 0 to limit.
Set item balance of fresh to 0.

To advance from spot (a whole number).
For every balance from 0 to limit.
If item balance of possible is 1 and character spot of source is "(" and balance is less than limit, set item (balance plus 1) of fresh to 1.
If item balance of possible is 1 and character spot of source is ")" and balance is more than 0, set item (balance minus 1) of fresh to 1.
If item balance of possible is 1 and character spot of source is "*" and balance is less than limit, set item (balance plus 1) of fresh to 1.
If item balance of possible is 1 and character spot of source is "*" and balance is more than 0, set item (balance minus 1) of fresh to 1.
If item balance of possible is 1 and character spot of source is "*", set item balance of fresh to 1.

To adopt from marker (a whole number).
For every balance from 0 to limit.
Set item balance of possible to item balance of fresh.

For every spot from 0 to limit.
Wipe from 0.
Advance from spot.
Adopt from 0.

If item 0 of possible is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
